         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The FODM8061 is a 3.3 Vâ€Š/â€Š5 V high-speed logic gate output (open collector) optocoupler, which supports isolated communications allowing digital signals to communicate between systems without conducting ground loops or hazardous voltages.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
